## 5. Security-Linter S4-L3 Pre-existing Failure Summary

The S4-L3 test (`Endpoint allowlist Stage 4`) fails on **both** the base branch (`918e18a`) and all fix/ branches with the **same 2 test failures**. These failures are due to Stage 5 endpoints (`scheduled-triggers`, `deferred-execution`) not being listed in the Stage 4 allowlist — a pre-existing governance issue predating PR-101. **PR-101 changes introduced zero new security-linter failures.**

S3-L7 (immutability check) now **PASSES** on `fix/admin-mount-pr101` (governance docs removed from `src/`).

