## 7. Outstanding Issues

1. **Lint regression on `fix/workflow-instance-terminal-start`** — `workflow-instances.service.spec.ts` has Windows CRLF line endings. Fix: `npx prettier --write tests/unit/workflow-instances/workflow-instances.service.spec.ts` and recommit.
2. **`RAILWAY_TOKEN` expired** — Regenerate at [Railway Dashboard → Account → Tokens](https://railway.app/account/tokens).
3. **`ADMIN_JWKS_URL` not set in Railway** — Must be set before deploy: `ADMIN_JWKS_URL=https://practical-amazement-production.up.railway.app/.well-known/jwks.json`
4. **Neither PR merged** — Both PRs await human approval.

